    "confidence": "verified",
    "notes": "IDENTITY: the requested year 2009 is wrong for this perfume. Fragrantica and Parfumo both give 2016 (perfumer Sonia Constant); 2009 is when the Collection Extraordinaire line began. Marketed for women and men (unisex) on both databases. Sources disagree sharply on the pyramid. Fragrantica (above): top Patchouli Leaf, Cacao, Woodsy Notes; middle Bulgarian Rose, Iris Flower; base Suede, Leather, Fruity Notes. The official Van Cleef & Arpels product page: 'Top notes: Bergamot, Pink peppercorn; Heart notes: Rose, Iris; Base notes: Patchouli, Suede accord'. Parfumo (marked source-backed and verified) matches the brand: top Pink pepper, Bergamot; heart Rose, Iris; base Patchouli, Suede. Fragrantica's placement of patchouli in the top and leather/fruity notes in the base looks like it was built from the brand's prose ('suede accord, imbued with leather and fruity accents') rather than its pyramid. The brand pyramid is the better-supported one. Not to be confused with Moonlight Patchouli Le Parfum 2022 (Fragrantica 77937)."
